### Is your feature request related to a problem? Please describe.

Starting an openai-chat-compatible web api from an arbitrary agent

### Describe the solution you'd like

```csharp
// Server side
IAgent alice;
IAgent bob;

// add muliple agents to the server
app.UseAgentAsOpenAIChatCompletionEndpoint(alice); // this will start an OpenAI API at /v1/chat/completions and will be triggered when model field equals to "alice"
app.UseAgentAsOpenAIChatCompletionEndpoint(bob); // this will start an OpenAI API at /v1/chat/completions and will be triggered when model field equals to "bob"


app.StartAsync();
```

```csharp
// client side
// Suppose the service is running at localhost:8080
// We can use `OpenAIChatAgent` to consume that backend
var openaiClient = CreateOpenAIClient(client); // check Example 16 on how to connect to a third-party OpenAI API backend
var alice= new OpenAIChatAgent(openaiClient, "alice")
            .RegisterMessageConnector();

await alice.SendAsync("Hello");

// if agent is an `IStreamingAgent`, the service will also support streaming

await foreach(var chunk in alice.GenerateStreamingReply(xx))
{
    // process chunks
}
```


